<title>ARGENTINA: Comercial del Plata in $65 mln capital increase.</title>
<headline>Comercial del Plata in $65 mln capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Buenos Aires Stock Exchnage said Thursday it has approved a $65 million capital increase by holding company Comercial del Plata SA.</p>
<p>The increase is made up of 6.5 million ordinary shares valued at $10 each, it said.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
